{
    "title": "Simple Nanny - Baby Monitor",
    "description": "<u>Turn 2 phones into a <b>baby monitor</b>!</u>\r\n\r\n<b>Simple Nanny</b> will help you to watch over your sleeping baby in cases such as:\r\n\u2022\u2003 when you went out to your neighbor for a moment,\r\n\u2022\u2003 when you party with your friends in another room,\r\n\u2022\u2003 when you have to work while your baby is sleeping,\r\n\u2022\u2003 and in many other cases.\r\n\r\n<b>Simple Nanny</b> will notify you immediately if your baby wakes up.\r\nWith your phone you can remotely:\r\n\u2022\u2003 lull your baby again with your voice,\r\n\u2022\u2003 help your baby fall asleep with the built-in lullaby,\r\n\u2022\u2003 see and hear your baby at any time (baby cam),\r\n\u2022\u2003 monitor that everything is ok.\r\n\r\nSee how easy it is to get started:\r\n\u2022\u2003 install <b>Simple Nanny</b> on two phones (*),\r\n\u2022\u2003 set one phone near the child and select the \u201cBaby\u201d role,\r\n\u2022\u2003 take the second phone with you and select the \"Parents\" role.\r\n\r\n(*) Reuse your old phone as one of the phones - be eco!\r\n    Use your personal phone as a second.\r\n\r\nWatch a simple tutorial after starting the application.\r\nWe can always help: support@simplenanny.app",
    "descriptionHTML": "<u>Turn 2 phones into a <b>baby monitor</b>!</u><br><br><b>Simple Nanny</b> will help you to watch over your sleeping baby in cases such as:<br>\u2022\u2003 when you went out to your neighbor for a moment,<br>\u2022\u2003 when you party with your friends in another room,<br>\u2022\u2003 when you have to work while your baby is sleeping,<br>\u2022\u2003 and in many other cases.<br><br><b>Simple Nanny</b> will notify you immediately if your baby wakes up.<br>With your phone you can remotely:<br>\u2022\u2003 lull your baby again with your voice,<br>\u2022\u2003 help your baby fall asleep with the built-in lullaby,<br>\u2022\u2003 see and hear your baby at any time (baby cam),<br>\u2022\u2003 monitor that everything is ok.<br><br>See how easy it is to get started:<br>\u2022\u2003 install <b>Simple Nanny</b> on two phones (*),<br>\u2022\u2003 set one phone near the child and select the \u201cBaby\u201d role,<br>\u2022\u2003 take the second phone with you and select the &quot;Parents&quot; role.<br><br>(*) Reuse your old phone as one of the phones - be eco!<br>    Use your personal phone as a second.<br><br>Watch a simple tutorial after starting the application.<br>We can always help: support@simplenanny.app",
